[38;2;124;124;124mNow I have all the pieces. Let me write the complete proof.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe proof structure:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m1. **$f_4$ is irreducible** → $\langle f_4 \rangle$ is prime → $R/\langle f_4 [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\rangle$ is a domain.[0m
